  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Statiskt, plan. av fas 3</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistics Ukr ph 3, plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to make a thorough planning of phase 3 of the cooperation between The Statistical Committee of Ukraine and Statistics Sweden, two experts from Statistics Sweden will go to Ukraine to carry out a LFA-seminar and together with the local counterpart work out project documentation based on the LFA principles.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Med syfte att g&#xf6;ra en noggrann planering av fas 3 i samarbetet mellan SCB och &quot;The Statistical Committee of Ukraine&quot;, kommer tv&#xe5; experter fr&#xe5;n SCB att h&#xe5;lla ett LFA-seminarium och tillsammans med samarbets- partnern utarbeta en projekt dokumentation baserad p&#xe5; LFA-principer.</narrative>
  </description>
